1
00:00:00,250 --> 00:00:01,244
The Sun does not

2
00:00:01,244 --> 00:00:02,226
pull the planets.

3
00:00:02,505 --> 00:00:03,600
It warps space-time.

4
00:00:03,879 --> 00:00:05,207
School drew gravity as

5
00:00:05,207 --> 00:00:06,156
a force, a tug

6
00:00:06,156 --> 00:00:07,251
across empty space.

7
00:00:07,530 --> 00:00:09,305
Einstein's picture is different.

8
00:00:09,584 --> 00:00:11,203
Mass curves space-time, and

9
00:00:11,203 --> 00:00:12,755
anything moving through it

10
00:00:12,755 --> 00:00:14,419
follows the straightest path

11
00:00:14,419 --> 00:00:15,692
it can. For Earth,

12
00:00:15,815 --> 00:00:16,987
near the Sun, that

13
00:00:16,987 --> 00:00:17,981
path is an orbit.

14
00:00:18,260 --> 00:00:19,711
One caveat: this dented

15
00:00:19,711 --> 00:00:21,207
sheet is a two-dimensional

16
00:00:21,207 --> 00:00:22,648
stand-in for curvature in

17
00:00:22,648 --> 00:00:24,211
four dimensions, three of

18
00:00:24,211 --> 00:00:25,205
space and one of

19
00:00:25,205 --> 00:00:26,645
time. The proof came

20
00:00:26,645 --> 00:00:28,655
in 1919. During a

21
00:00:28,655 --> 00:00:30,609
total eclipse, starlight grazing

22
00:00:30,609 --> 00:00:31,547
the Sun bent by

23
00:00:31,547 --> 00:00:34,037
about 1.75 arcseconds, as

24
00:00:34,037 --> 00:00:35,812
Einstein predicted. So why

25
00:00:35,812 --> 00:00:37,252
does Earth keep circling?

26
00:00:37,531 --> 00:00:38,916
That is the straightest

27
00:00:38,916 --> 00:00:39,731
road there is.
